{
  "episode": 64,
  "source": "assets/video/ep64.mp4",
  "model": "base",
  "duration": 318.2759375,
  "segments": [
    {
      "i": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 7.0,
      "text": "Journey to the West, Chapter 64, magnificent silk vests."
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "start": 7.0,
      "end": 15.0,
      "text": "I hope that monkey finds a lot of food."
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "start": 15.0,
      "end": 16.0,
      "text": "Said Bajai."
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "start": 16.0,
      "end": 18.0,
      "text": "I'm hungry."
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "start": 18.0,
      "end": 21.0,
      "text": "The Tang Monk shivered and hugged himself."
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "start": 21.0,
      "end": 22.0,
      "text": "I'm so cold."
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "start": 22.0,
      "end": 28.0,
      "text": "He said, he looked up at the monastery again and then back at his companions."
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "start": 28.0,
      "end": 32.0,
      "text": "Do you too believe there are demons up there?"
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "start": 32.0,
      "end": 35.0,
      "text": "Woo-jing stroked his chin."
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "start": 35.0,
      "end": 37.0,
      "text": "I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "start": 37.0,
      "end": 39.0,
      "text": "Woo-kong believed it though."
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "start": 39.0,
      "end": 41.0,
      "text": "Bajai snorted."
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "start": 41.0,
      "end": 43.0,
      "text": "Woo-kong is too careful."
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "start": 43.0,
      "end": 46.0,
      "text": "He's always worried that we'll bump into a demon."
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "start": 46.0,
      "end": 49.0,
      "text": "His stomach grumbled."
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "start": 49.0,
      "end": 53.0,
      "text": "Oh, I'm starving."
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "start": 53.0,
      "end": 56.0,
      "text": "Woo-jing looked at the monastery again."
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "start": 56.0,
      "end": 60.0,
      "text": "That place looks perfectly safe to me."
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "start": 60.0,
      "end": 62.0,
      "text": "Bajai nodded."
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "start": 62.0,
      "end": 64.0,
      "text": "It looks warm too."
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "start": 64.0,
      "end": 66.0,
      "text": "Maybe the monks there will take us in."
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "start": 66.0,
      "end": 68.0,
      "text": "It would be nice to get out of this cold."
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "start": 68.0,
      "end": 70.0,
      "text": "Said the Tang Monk."
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "start": 70.0,
      "end": 72.0,
      "text": "That settles it."
    },
    {
      "i": 25,
      "start": 72.0,
      "end": 73.0,
      "text": "Said the pig."
    },
    {
      "i": 26,
      "start": 73.0,
      "end": 76.0,
      "text": "Who cares what that monkey thinks?"
    },
    {
      "i": 27,
      "start": 76.0,
      "end": 78.0,
      "text": "What does he know?"
    },
    {
      "i": 28,
      "start": 78.0,
      "end": 84.0,
      "text": "Let's go up there, get warm and eat some food."
    },
    {
      "i": 29,
      "start": 84.0,
      "end": 87.0,
      "text": "The Tang Monk climbed back onto the horse"
    },
    {
      "i": 30,
      "start": 87.0,
      "end": 92.0,
      "text": "and the three travelers headed toward the monastery."
    },
    {
      "i": 31,
      "start": 92.0,
      "end": 96.0,
      "text": "When they got there, no people were around."
    },
    {
      "i": 32,
      "start": 96.0,
      "end": 98.0,
      "text": "This place is deserted."
    },
    {
      "i": 33,
      "start": 98.0,
      "end": 100.0,
      "text": "Said Woo-jing."
    },
    {
      "i": 34,
      "start": 100.0,
      "end": 105.0,
      "text": "Bajai knocked on the door, but no one answered."
    },
    {
      "i": 35,
      "start": 105.0,
      "end": 107.0,
      "text": "Hello!"
    },
    {
      "i": 36,
      "start": 107.0,
      "end": 108.0,
      "text": "The pig called."
    },
    {
      "i": 37,
      "start": 108.0,
      "end": 111.0,
      "text": "Is anybody in there?"
    },
    {
      "i": 38,
      "start": 111.0,
      "end": 114.0,
      "text": "Again, there was no answer."
    },
    {
      "i": 39,
      "start": 114.0,
      "end": 117.0,
      "text": "Bajai looked at his companions."
    },
    {
      "i": 40,
      "start": 117.0,
      "end": 120.0,
      "text": "Maybe the monks didn't hear me."
    },
    {
      "i": 41,
      "start": 120.0,
      "end": 122.0,
      "text": "His eyes lit up."
    },
    {
      "i": 42,
      "start": 122.0,
      "end": 125.0,
      "text": "Maybe they're all in the kitchen cooking food."
    },
    {
      "i": 43,
      "start": 125.0,
      "end": 128.0,
      "text": "With noodles boiling and vegetable sizzling,"
    },
    {
      "i": 44,
      "start": 128.0,
      "end": 131.0,
      "text": "a kitchen can be quite noisy."
    },
    {
      "i": 45,
      "start": 131.0,
      "end": 135.0,
      "text": "The pig's stomach growled again."
    },
    {
      "i": 46,
      "start": 135.0,
      "end": 137.0,
      "text": "I'll go in and find out."
    },
    {
      "i": 47,
      "start": 137.0,
      "end": 140.0,
      "text": "He opened the door and stepped inside."
    },
    {
      "i": 48,
      "start": 140.0,
      "end": 144.0,
      "text": "The monastery was dark and silent."
    },
    {
      "i": 49,
      "start": 144.0,
      "end": 146.0,
      "text": "I don't hear anyone cooking."
    },
    {
      "i": 50,
      "start": 146.0,
      "end": 148.0,
      "text": "Bajai said to himself."
    },
    {
      "i": 51,
      "start": 148.0,
      "end": 151.0,
      "text": "Maybe there isn't anyone here."
    }
  ]
}
